# Per-machine Claude Code settings (permissions granted on this Mac) —
# never shared through the repo. The whole folder: Claude Code also
# drops lock files there (scheduled_tasks.lock), and any untracked file
# makes the daily automatic update skip itself as "not clean" — found
# 2026-09-26, when the 06:00 run had skipped for exactly that reason.
.claude/

# Local marker that pauses the daily automatic update (see CLAUDE.md).
data/.work-in-progress

